        {
          "_key": "995tbklh",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "AI video creation has gone from \"nice experiment\" to everyday workflow surprisingly fast. What once required editing skills, timelines, and a lot of patience can now be done with a short text prompt and a few clicks. This shift has opened the door for creators, marketers, and small teams who want fast, visual content without a steep learning curve.\nAmong all the tools riding this wave, CapCut stands out. Known originally as a free, beginner-friendly video editor, CapCut has quietly evolved into one of the most widely used AI video platforms in the world. Backed by ByteDance, it combines polished templates, automation, and powerful AI features into a tool that feels both playful and practical."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
