        {
          "_key": "7l93buq4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "CapCut recently introduced AI video generation, allowing users to create videos from text prompts. While not as advanced as dedicated AI video generators, it integrates smoothly into the editing workflow."
